---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Policy | ZypheroLab"
  description="ZypheroLab Privacy Policy."
  canonical="https://zypherolab.com/en/privacy/"
  hreflangRo="https://zypherolab.com/privacy/"
  hreflangEn="https://zypherolab.com/en/privacy/"
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container text-center" style="padding-top: 120px; padding-bottom: 60px;">
      <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="content" style="text-align: left; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text-secondary);">
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>Your privacy is important to us. This policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and why. ZypheroLab does not use invasive tracking cookies.</p>
        
        <br><h2>2. Data Collected</h2>
        <p>We only collect the information strictly necessary that you provide through our contact form (name, email address, project details). We do not sell or share your data with third parties.</p>
        
        <br><h2>3. Third-Party Processors</h2>
        <p>Our contact form uses Formspree. Data submitted through the form is processed according to Formspree's policies and goes exclusively to our inbox so we can respond to your request.</p>
        
        <br><h2>4. Zero Tracking</h2>
        <p>As mentioned throughout our site, we rely strictly on Google Search Console to monitor the technical performance of our website. We do not use user tracking scripts, heatmaps, or other invasive tools.</p>

        <br><h2>5. Your Rights (GDPR)</h2>
        <p>If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA), you have the right to request access to your data, its deletion, or restriction of processing. For any requests, you can contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@zypherolab.com" style="color: var(--primary);">hello@zypherolab.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
